1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,600
I started this in a spare room, with one laptop and a bad idea.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:07,300
The first version? Nobody wanted it. I rebuilt it twice.

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:12,400
What changed was listening. I sat with people and just watched them work.

4
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:16,600
Today we are a small team, and it still starts with listening.

5
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:20,300
If that sounds like how you want to work, come and see.
